    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0688" n="618" xml:id="pg618"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/865a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-01-31T18:00:00-05:00">January 31, 1934—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>14. For Reuben Clark from the Executive [Committee of] Council: No. 8. Kindly
                    advise status proposed decree. Are you sailing February 1 as planned?</p>
                <p>For Gibson: In event Clark’s departure before arrival this cable can you inform
                    Council through Department regarding preceding?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
